    <description>See the finding. Review the change.

PC Tweaker brings Windows tuning, audio diagnostics, privacy and maintenance into one review workflow for Windows 10/11 x64. Inspect findings and supported settings before deciding what to apply.

What you can inspect:
- Scan findings across performance, junk files, startup, privacy, registry, memory, hardware, latency and audio.
- Audio device formats, effects, spatial sound and Equalizer APO status, with findings such as a Bluetooth headset in call mode or a muted microphone. The app does not change microphone volume on its own.
- Read-only hardware information and driver DPC/ISR traces for investigating a specific workload.
- Change history with previous values and restoration for supported settings.

The current catalog has 84 controls: 48 Free and 36 Pro. Free requires no account or card. Optional paid plans add advanced tools; check the official site and checkout for current prices and terms. Feature availability depends on Windows, hardware and drivers. A finding does not guarantee that a change will improve performance.

Review each control's trade-offs. Restoration covers supported settings; permanently deleted files, repairs and driver operations have separate recovery limits. An FPS increase or lower latency is not guaranteed.

View the current 1.20-series interface previews and capture details: https://github.com/AurelioAvila/pc-tweaker-app/blob/master/docs/screenshots/README.md . These are Pro-view browser-demo captures with synthetic data, not native Windows measurements or customer results.

This package downloads the official 1.20.1 x64 installer with a fixed SHA-256. It is publisher-signed by Aurelio Avila with a trusted timestamp. SmartScreen may still display a reputation warning. Installation is for the user running Chocolatey, in %LocalAppData%\PC Tweaker; earlier package versions used MSI. No tweak or driver operation is requested by this package.

PC Tweaker is proprietary/freemium. Viewable source is not an OSI-approved open-source license.</description>
    <summary>Windows tuning and audio diagnostics with recorded changes</summary>
    <releaseNotes>1.20.1: checkout and billing error messages follow the app language. A PC clock running ahead no longer ends Pro up to a day early. Full release notes: https://github.com/AurelioAvila/pc-tweaker-app/releases/tag/v1.20.2</releaseNotes>
